# LeakSanitizer suppressions for the Debug (ASan) test run. Keep this list minimal.
#
# ONNX Runtime 1.19.2 (prebuilt, uninstrumented) allocates 2 x 32 bytes of process-global state on
# first session creation and never frees them. Constant per process (does not grow with the number
# of sessions), allocated from inside libonnxruntime with no JAudios frames on the stack.
leak:libonnxruntime.so
